flowchart TD
    A[Read active specification and acceptance ID] --> B[Select one observable behavior]
    B --> C[Write and run failing test]
    C --> D{Failure proves missing behavior?}
    D -->|No| E[Fix test setup or fixture]
    E --> C
    D -->|Yes| F[Minimal production change on feat branch]
    F --> G[Run focused test]
    G --> H{Passes?}
    H -->|No| F
    H -->|Yes| I[Refactor and run affected suite]
    I --> J[Record actual evidence and update tasks]
    J --> K{More behaviors in slice?}
    K -->|Yes| B
    K -->|No| L[Review diff and prepare evidence-led PR]
